{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"meat_haunch","model_identifier":"meat_haunch","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## meat_haunch\n\nCarried load, animal goods.\n\n- Cubes: 6 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -4.2..10.5, y -3.0..4.0, z -8.2..-0.8 (size 14.8 x 7.0 x 7.5 u = 41 x 20 x 21 cm).\nMeat haunch: a big raw leg of meat (~45 cm) with a fat cap and the white shank bone and knuckle sticking out to the right (+X). Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.0.\n"},"description":"## meat_haunch\n\nCarried load, animal goods.\n\n- Cubes: 6 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -4.2..10.5, y -3.0..4.0, z -8.2..-0.8 (size 14.8 x 7.0 x 7.5 u = 41 x 20 x 21 cm).\nMeat haunch: a big raw leg of meat (~45 cm) with a fat cap and the white shank bone and knuckle sticking out to the right (+X). Origin = **slot_carry** (front of the chest): the load sits in both arms, its back face at z = 0 against the chest and its underside at the forearms. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 3.0.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"meat","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.0,-3.0,-8.0],"to":[3.0,3.0,-1.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,8,7.0,14.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[7,8,14.0,14.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[14,8,21.0,14.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[21,8,28.0,14.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[12,0,19.0,7.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[19,0,26.0,7.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"186f